#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:16
msgid ""
"Linting tools help you keep ROS code consistent, maintainable, and ready for "
"review. This article describes how to use ``ament_lint`` CLI utilities to "
"check copyright notices, C++ code, Python code, XML, CMake files, and "
"formatting. After you follow these steps, you can identify and fix common "
"code quality issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Learn how to use ``ament_lint`` and related tools to identify and "
"fix code quality issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:26
msgid "**Tutorial level:** Advanced"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:28
msgid "**Time:** 10 minutes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:32
msgid "Table of Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:35
msgid "Summary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:37
msgid ""
"All ``ament_lint`` tools accept files or directories, analyse them, and "
"generate reports. Use ``--help`` for the most accurate options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:40
msgid "Common tools include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:42
msgid "``ament_copyright`` to check or add copyright and license notices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:44
msgid "``ament_cppcheck`` for C++ static analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:46
msgid "``ament_cpplint`` for C++ style checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:48
msgid "``ament_flake8`` for Python linting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Ament-Lint-For-Clean-Code.rst:50
